{'symbol': 'CME', 'date': '2022-07-12 02:00:00', 'title': 'CME GROUP INTERNATIONAL AVERAGE DAILY VOLUME REACHED 6.3 MILLION CONTRACTS IN Q2 2022, UP 21% FROM Q2 2021', 'text': "LONDON AND SINGAPORE , JULY 12, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CME GROUP, THE WORLD'S LEADING DERIVATIVES MARKETPLACE, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS QUARTERLY INTERNATIONAL AVERAGE DAILY VOLUME (ADV) REACHED 6.3 MILLION CONTRACTS IN Q2 2022, UP 21% YEAR ON YEAR.\xa0 REFLECTING ALL TRADING REPORTED FROM OUTSIDE THE UNITED STATES, VOLUME WAS DRIVEN LARGELY BY 43% GROWTH IN EQUITY INDEX PRODUCTS, A 28% INCREASE IN INTEREST RATE PRODUCTS, A 24% RISE IN FOREIGN EXCHANGE PRODUCTS AND A 44% GROWTH IN EQUITY OPTIONS."}